From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NXP-MR <meta-nxp-mr@nxp.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 17:05:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] libcamera: sensor: Add imx708_wide sensor properties

The camera sensor properties database has an entry for "imx708" but not
for the Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3 Wide, whose sensor reports the model
string "imx708_wide" (shipped on the NAVQ95). Without an entry libcamera
logs on every camera enumeration:

    WARN CameraSensorProperties No static properties available for 'imx708_wide'
    WARN CameraSensorProperties Please consider updating the camera sensor properties database

The wide module uses the same imx708 sensor, only a different lens, so the
sensor properties (unit cell size, test pattern modes, sensor delays) are
identical. Add an "imx708_wide" entry mirroring the "imx708" one.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [RPi-specific sensor model suffix]

Signed-off-by: NXP-MR <meta-nxp-mr@nxp.com>
---
 src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp | 17 +++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp b/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp
index fd81beb..ff6ae6a 100644
--- a/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/sensor/camera_sensor_properties.cpp
@@ -331,6 +331,23 @@ const CameraSensorProperties *CameraSensorProperties::get(const std::string &sen
 				.hblankDelay = 3
 			},
 		} },
+		{ "imx708_wide", {
+			/* Raspberry Pi Camera Module 3 Wide: same imx708 sensor. */
+			.unitCellSize = { 1400, 1400 },
+			.testPatternModes = {
+				{ controls::draft::TestPatternModeOff, 0 },
+				{ controls::draft::TestPatternModeColorBars, 1 },
+				{ controls::draft::TestPatternModeSolidColor, 2 },
+				{ controls::draft::TestPatternModeColorBarsFadeToGray, 3 },
+				{ controls::draft::TestPatternModePn9, 4 },
+			},
+			.sensorDelays = {
+				.exposureDelay = 2,
+				.gainDelay = 2,
+				.vblankDelay = 3,
+				.hblankDelay = 3
+			},
+		} },
 		{ "mx95mbcam", {
 			/* Camera module based on OX03C10 + MAX96717 serializer  */
 			.unitCellSize = { 3000, 3000 },
-- 
2.34.1
